{"seq":26,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/si-04-quarrendon-main-contact/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:16:11.229Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"8a8f2930405ddc6e0c5a20ef1851a75557ebcb06f10c7094e7b9c8ecbb9ca8be","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","text":"I answered Ilse in a thread on their message in #north-team. The main contact for the door 6 duplicate arrivals at Quarrendon Freight Lines is **Thea Ramaswell**, their Director of Yard Operations.\n\n- **Where it came from:** On 20 Aug 2025, Dana posted in #north-team that Thea had flagged duplicate arrivals on door 6 again, on the morning shift. The same trailer showed up as two 06:30 check-ins because the driver checked in at the kiosk and then dispatch added him by hand. Dana was handling it on our side.\n- **Second source:** The North team cheat sheet, a public note, also names Thea as QFL's main contact.\n\nI only used what Ilse can see: #north-team, which they're a member of, and public brain notes. The account's file folder (contracts, tickets, CRM) came back empty, so I couldn't check whether a ticket was ever opened for door 6."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791987000.000131"}}
